
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
  <title>Security Research | PoC</title>

  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #080d18;
      --panel: #101a2b;
      --border: #263750;
      --accent: #36d6c5;
      --text: #e8eef8;
      --muted: #91a2ba;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      padding: 24px;
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse at top, #142640, transparent 65%),
        var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
    }

    .container {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 760px;
    }

    .topline {
      color: var(--accent);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 3px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .card {
      background: rgba(16, 26, 43, 0.96);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 36px;
      box-shadow: 0 24px 80px #0005;
    }

    .status {
      display: inline-block;
      color: var(--accent);
      border: 1px solid #36d6c555;
      background: #36d6c510;
      border-radius: 5px;
      padding: 7px 10px;
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(28px, 5vw, 42px);
      line-height: 1.15;
      margin: 24px 0 14px;
      letter-spacing: -1px;
    }

    h1 span {
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    .description {
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.8;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .details {
      display: grid;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .item {
      background: #0a1220;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 9px;
      padding: 16px;
    }

    .label {
      display: block;
      color: var(--muted);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1.5px;
      font-size: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .value {
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-family: ui-monospace, monospace;
    }

    .notice {
      margin-top: 24px;
      padding: 15px;
      border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
      background: #36d6c509;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    footer {
      color: #65758c;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 11px;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 520px) {
      .card {
        padding: 24px 18px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <main class="container">
    <div class="topline">SECURITY RESEARCH / PoC</div>

    <section class="card">
      <span class="status">AUTHORIZED TEST ENVIRONMENT</span>

      <h1>Subdomain Takeover<br><span>Proof of Concept</span></h1>

      <p class="description">
        This page is a demonstration for documenting a potential
        subdomain misconfiguration during an authorized security
        assessment. Its presence alone does not establish a
        confirmed vulnerability.
      </p>

      <div class="details">
        <div class="item">
          <span class="label">Target Subdomain</span>
          <div class="value">your-lab.example.com</div>
        </div>

        <div class="item">
          <span class="label">DNS Record</span>
          <div class="value">CNAME — replace with verified evidence</div>
        </div>

        <div class="item">
          <span class="label">Affected Service</span>
          <div class="value">Not yet verified</div>
        </div>

        <div class="item">
          <span class="label">Assessment Status</span>
          <div class="value">Demonstration only</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="notice">
        <strong>Research Notice</strong><br>
        Use only on systems you own or are explicitly authorized
        to test. No user data has been accessed or modified by
        this demonstration page.
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
      Responsible Disclosure · Security Research · PoC
    </footer>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
